              "Speaking last week, Trump agreed it was a big moment. “I’m very prepared. I’ve been preparing for it all my life,” he said. China “wants to make a deal and we’re very happy with that”. Officials in Beijing were more cautious. China “hopes the Xi-Trump meeting goes smoothly,” said foreign affairs vice-minister Wang Chao. The markets are certainly nervous",
